        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Franklin Pierce, American military officer\n- Organizations: Democratic National Convention, United States Whig Party\n- Places: Fort Meigs, United States, state\n- Events: 1852 Democratic National Convention, Treaty of Fort Meigs\n- Topics: Search the City\n\nFacts:\n- The 1852 Democratic National Convention nominated Franklin Pierce over an American military officer.\n- The American military officer represented a state in the United States Whig Party.\n- The American military officer represented the United States of America when signing the Treaty of Fort Meigs.\n- The band Search the City is from that same state.",
